    "long_instructions": "**☑️ Do This:**\r\n\r\n- Visualize your model with `visualize_model`.\r\n- In your Project Planning Guide, respond to the question in **Step 5: Modeling**, under **Visualizing**.\r\n\r\n**💻 Coding Tip**\r\n\r\n`visualize_model` accepts any model as its first argument. It also takes a keyword argument, `feature_names`, which is a list of features in the order they appear in your matrix.\r\n\r\n```\r\nvisualize_model(model, feature_names=[\"Feature 1\", \"Feature 2\", \"Feature 3\"])\r\n```",
